OL,3,GNEWSACalls for 'crumbling' crown court
OL,4,Ato be pulled down
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarristers have called for Nottingham
OL,7,FCrown Court to be knocked down and
OL,8,Freplaced after a crack in a wall forced
OL,9,Fthe building to temporarily close.
OL,11,FHM Courts and Tribunals Service (HMCTS)
OL,12,Fsaid the cracking was located at the
OL,13,Fentrance of the building and some cases
OL,14,Fhave been moved to Nottingham
OL,15,FMagistrates' Court.
OL,17,FThey said the crown court was expected
OL,18,Fto fully reopen on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
