OL,3,GNEWSACalls for 'crumbling' crown court
OL,4,Ato be pulled down
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmong those raising concerns was
OL,7,Fbarrister and former Broxtowe
OL,8,FConservative MP Anna Soubry, who said
OL,9,Fthe building was "a lost cause; we
OL,10,Fshould demolish the place and start
OL,11,Fagain".
